This removes the ~5-16 fold CAR-only up cancer carry-over cloud while retaining the more modest |log2FC|<2 CAR vs CAR+IL15 immune differences.

It is a descriptive mask of the contrast statistic, not true decontamination. It is circular on the test statistic you want to interpret, it will also discard genuine strong IL-15 driven CAR-T programmes, it does not remove contaminating reads from the genes you keep and it changes shrinkage/FDR. Defensible remediation remains experimental post-sort purity >99% with a tumour dump channel, post-sort flow/qPCR, and in silico modelling SoupX/DecontX/CellBender/CIBERSORTx against tumour-only and T-cell-only references before differential testing.

